{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7a973b65258056a81f339589b40a8c3a1024b2dd011b977cd19e1e28a720b8a1", "ja": "あっと驚く和の心", "zh": "令人惊艳的大和之心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "08414939a1e28e386c2035f2209678ea429b1c0df16720c5ad3e0a2a23ebcb78", "ja": "比較的料理が得意なメンバーが多いため、\n全員で調理に挑む事になった和食チーム。\n魚担当の可憐は包丁の扱いに緊張しつつも、\n響や歩に励まされ、勇気を出して魚を捌く。\n比較的……比較的？", "zh": "由于队伍里有不少比较擅长料理的成员，\n和食组决定全员一起挑战烹饪。\n负责处理鱼的可怜虽然对菜刀的使用感到紧张，\n但在响和步的鼓励下，鼓起勇气处理起了鱼。\n比较擅长……比较？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "fb7930e3364d7287d8135560771450c76791d11571a2a865cabcf8ef426dff1f", "ja": "くんくん……。可憐のチームから、\nすっごく美味しそうな匂いがしてるぞ！", "zh": "嗅嗅……可怜那组传来特别香的味道哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "653a46ff9fa98394c746b5e3238873e7d544a7fa9df61cc06f7c5eaa4301deba", "ja": "こ、これは、かつお節でだしをとっている匂いです。\nだしの香りって、なんだかほっとしますよね……。", "zh": "这、这是用柴鱼片熬高汤的香味。高汤的香气，总让人不由得安心下来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e309bb50c5eed3acf4654b77258ccd88714b44bea63d67d93633527161cdcc2b", "ja": "アタシもアメリカにいた頃、和食が恋しくなったコト\nあったなー。なんか、安心するんだよね。", "zh": "我在美国的时候，也有过想念和食的日子呢。总觉得特别让人安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "bdb02299de8de592af0bf0f4a26bcd0d8c454e37d75d34712577f07c48b0b5bf", "ja": "はい……わ、私達のチームは、お料理のできる人が\n多いので……みんなで、作業を分担しようって……。", "zh": "是……我、我们队伍里会做饭的人很多……所以……大家一起分工来做吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "857a3f69f51f7e2f325247a4f861e9f07084bfa03e09bf644172e7bca1b084a6", "ja": "私は、お魚担当なので……ま、まずは三枚におろし\nますね……料理は見た目も大切なので、慎重に……。", "zh": "我是负责处理鱼的……所、所以先把鱼片成三片……料理的外观也很重要，要小心一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "ea7dd1ad83dcd6df4edc494d652f90fe9ee0006ab2223519db5e2eb6d847fae7", "ja": "頭とわたをぬいて、おなかに包丁を入れて……\nまっすぐ……ま、ま、まっすぐ……っ！", "zh": "去掉鱼头和内脏，从肚子那里下刀……直、直、直着来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "6aa313da25a01e97a88675809bffb3a5c25c60d427e8520a533ffcc862f8c9d8", "ja": "わーっ！　可憐、ものすごく手が震えてるぞっ！\n本当に大丈夫なの！？", "zh": "哇——！可怜，你的手抖得好厉害啊！\n真的没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "eeac474b1a60f08366d6604a0d664719ef736c5843cfb3637db6363d9bc2052d", "ja": "そんなに緊張しなくても平気だって、可憐！\nちょっと形が悪くても、食べたら同じなんだしさ！", "zh": "不用那么紧张也没关系啦，可怜！\n就算形状不太好看，吃起来还不是一样嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "ba1e646e198d28c7ce535ea6ca9c7860bc71b3733b04e244ed1cecec45a6b269", "ja": "そ……そうですよね。すみません……。\nちょっと、深呼吸します……す、すーっ、ふぅぅ～。", "zh": "是……是啊。对不起……  \n我先深呼吸一下……吸、吸——呼呜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "b42e2c543b8d4266a82ce3620a0f7c4e31e4e2712e9a4f6f43052dcc691aff3c", "ja": "ま、まずは、お魚の顔に布を被せて……\n抑える手は、猫の手……ほ、包丁を引くように……。", "zh": "那、首先，把布盖在鱼的脸上……按住鱼的手要像猫爪一样……要像拉刀那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_03_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "a9eacd53cf2e496701131fc0adfa06ed3148a3e7fabf26530bd3f55517800ba3", "ja": "うん……。こ、今度こそ大丈夫です。\nいきます……！", "zh": "嗯……这、这次一定没问题的。\n我要切了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
